smaller.

> 3. =A0Is there any way to check on the status of my pet? =A0I'd like to s=
ee how
> my little buddy is progressing.

Others have already mentioned stethescope and probing.

1) Chat with your pet to determine hunger status.  Learn the
various noises produced by dogs, cats, horses, etc.

2) Injured pets move away from combat.  Healthy pets move
towards combat.  This is far simpler and easier than a
stethescope but also less accurate.

Pets ignore weapon power - I lose a lot of pets to the watch
captain because of the damage of the long sword or silver
saber.

